### List schedules of one room (admin/student: all, faculty: only their own classes)
GET {{base}}/api/schedules?room_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by day / class
GET {{base}}/api/schedules?day=Tuesday&program_course=BSIT&year_level=2&section=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One schedule
GET {{base}}/api/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a recurring class (admin token). day_of_week is Monday-Saturday.
POST {{base}}/api/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 4,
  "day_of_week": "Tuesday",
  "start_time": "08:00",
  "end_time": "13:00",
  "subject_code": "ITEC 105",
  "subject_title": "Information Management",
  "program_course": "BSIT",
  "year_level": 2,
  "section": 2,
  "faculty_id": "PASTE_FACULTY_USER_ID"
}

### Edit (admin token) - only the fields you send change
PATCH {{base}}/api/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "09:00",
  "end_time": "12:00"
}

### Delete (admin token) - the class stops repeating every week
DELETE {{base}}/api/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Booking window: Sunday is closed (Saturday -> tomorrow disabled, Sunday -> today disabled)
GET {{base}}/api/booking-window
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student reservation on a Sunday -> 422
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 4,
  "faculty_id": "PASTE_FACULTY_USER_ID",
  "subject": "Review session",
  "reservation_date": "2026-11-15",
  "start_time": "13:00",
  "end_time": "15:00"
}
